<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>Export HTML to Word Document with JavaScript</title></head><body><a style="font-style: normal; font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: small; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;"></a><a name="JD_Constitucion_1993"></a><span><br><span></span></span><h1 class="Sumilla" style="font-style: normal; text-align: center;"><span class="Letraguinda" style=""><font color="#990000" style="font-size: 11pt;font-family: Arial;"><a name="REF_37111_1687536599662"></a><a name="REF_23152_1673973991915"></a></font><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: bold;"><span style="color: rgb(153, 0, 0); font-size: medium;">CONSTITUCIÓN POLÍTICA DEL PERÚ DE 1993</span></span><span><br><span></span></span></span></h1><p style="font-style: normal; font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;text-align:justify;;"><span style="font-size: small;"><a></a><a href="/spij-ext-web/detallenorma/H682680" ng-click="scrollTo('JD_Consti93-ingls')" style="text-decoration: underline;color: #008000; font-weight: bold">(VERSION DE LA CONSTITUCION POLITICA DEL PERU DE 1993 EN INGLES - MAYO 2013)</a><b><span><br><span></span></span></b>&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="font-style: normal; font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;text-align:justify;;"><span style="font-size: small;"><a></a><a href="/spij-ext-web/detallenorma/H682681" ng-click="scrollTo('JD_consti93-quechua')" style="text-decoration: underline;color: #008000; font-weight: bold">(VERSION DE LA CONSTITUCION POLITICA DEL PERU DE 1993 EN QUECHUA)</a><b></b>&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="font-style: normal; font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-size: small;"><font color="#333333" style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTA</b> </font><b>: Al texto de cada artículo de la Constitución Política del Perú de 1993 se ha incluido una sumilla de carácter referencial.<span><br><span></span></span></b>&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="font-style: normal; font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-size: small;"><b>FECHA DE PROMULGACIÓN:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;29-12-93<span><br><span></span></span></b>&nbsp;</span></p>
